This directory holds the config used for the official Family Chat distribution of
the desktop app (https://safechat.family).

- `build.json` is the electron-builder variant: application id, product name,
  executable/deb name and the `familychat://` protocol handler. It is selected
  with `VARIANT_PATH=familychat/build.json`, and is also the default variant.
- `config.json` is the desktop app config (it adds `update_base_url`). Bake it into
  the package by copying it over `webapp/config.json` before `pnpm run asar-webapp`.

Building with this config points the app at the Family Chat update feed, so you
probably only want it if you are producing the official Family Chat builds.
